        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(g) At the option of the employee and subject to the needs of the business, up to five (5) vacation days to which an employee is eligible may be carried over into the following year, provided that such carry-over vacation is scheduled and taken on or before June 30. An employee's request to carry over vacation will not be unreasonably denied.",
