        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(h) An Employee eligible to vacation as provided in this Article but who has not been able to take it due to needs of the business, may, at the discretion of the Company, be offered an allowance in lieu of such vacation. Such allowance in lieu thereof will be determined as follows:",
